sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client UI
    participant API as FastAPI command handler
    participant Redis as Redis idempotency guard
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant OB as workflow_outbox_events
    participant Publisher as Outbox publisher
    participant Broker as Celery Redis broker
    participant Worker as Domain event worker

    Client->>API: POST CreateStylingSession<br/>Idempotency-Key, Correlation-ID
    API->>API: Resolve authenticated actor and command type
    API->>PG: SELECT processed command by actor, type, key

    alt Completed command already exists
        PG-->>API: Stored response and correlation ID
        API-->>Client: Return original response, no new side effect
    else No committed command
        API->>Redis: SET idem lock NX EX

        alt Another request owns in-flight lock
            Redis-->>API: Lock not acquired
            API->>PG: Re-read processed command
            alt Winner committed while waiting
                PG-->>API: Stored response
                API-->>Client: Return original response
            else Winner still running
                API-->>Client: 409 or 202 Retry-After, same key required
            end
        else Lock acquired or Redis optional unavailable
            API->>PG: BEGIN
            API->>PG: Validate active body profile and active wardrobe revisions
            API->>PG: INSERT styling_sessions with immutable snapshots
            API->>PG: INSERT workflow_audit_events
            API->>PG: INSERT processed_workflow_commands unique actor/type/key
            API->>OB: INSERT StylingSessionOpened.v1 status pending
            Note over PG,OB: Aggregate, audit, command response and outbox event share one transaction
            API->>PG: COMMIT

            alt Unique command conflict at commit
                PG-->>API: IntegrityError on uq_workflow_command_idempotency
                API->>PG: ROLLBACK then SELECT winning command
                PG-->>API: Stored response
                API-->>Client: Return original response
            else Commit succeeds
                API->>Redis: Cache committed response with TTL
                API->>Redis: Release in-flight lock safely
                API-->>Client: 201 StylingSession response
            end
        end
    end

    loop Background publisher after commit
        Publisher->>PG: Claim pending events FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
        PG-->>Publisher: Locked outbox event batch
        Publisher->>PG: Mark events processing and increment attempt
        Publisher->>PG: COMMIT claim
        Publisher->>Broker: send_task event payload and event ID

        alt Broker accepted message
            Broker-->>Publisher: Accepted
            Publisher->>PG: Mark outbox event published with timestamp
        else Broker temporarily fails
            Publisher->>PG: Schedule retry with exponential backoff and last error
        end
    end

    Broker->>Worker: Deliver StylingSessionOpened.v1
    Worker->>PG: INSERT processed_event_deliveries unique consumer/event
    alt Delivery already handled
        PG-->>Worker: Unique conflict means no-op
    else First delivery
        Worker->>Worker: Run idempotent downstream action
        Worker->>PG: Mark delivery completed and commit
    end
